WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.435 --> 00:00:02.851
Lesson one. Hello!!

2
00:00:03.776 --> 00:00:10.826
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.568
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.618 --> 00:00:17.001
Today we learn: Hello!! Let's go!

5
00:00:18.498 --> 00:00:21.948
Hello! Say it with me. Hello!

6
00:00:25.917 --> 00:00:29.367
Hi! Say it with me. Hi!

7
00:00:33.358 --> 00:00:36.708
Teacher! Say it with me. Teacher!

8
00:00:40.718 --> 00:00:43.934
Friend! Say it with me. Friend!

9
00:00:47.953 --> 00:00:51.720
Good morning! Say it with me. Good morning!

10
00:00:55.742 --> 00:00:59.209
Name! Say it with me. Name!

11
00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:06.529
Class! Say it with me. Class!

12
00:01:10.557 --> 00:01:13.890
School! Say it with me. School!

13
00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:24.262
Listen. My name is Anna. What is your name?

14
00:01:24.312 --> 00:01:29.031
Say it with me. My name is Anna. What is your name?

15
00:01:33.837 --> 00:01:41.018
Hello! My name is Anna. This is my new school. Good morning, teacher and friends!

16
00:01:41.068 --> 00:01:42.583
I like this story!

17
00:01:43.324 --> 00:01:47.698
What's this?

18
00:01:47.748 --> 00:01:49.247
It's a teacher!

19
00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:54.564
What's this?

20
00:01:54.614 --> 00:01:55.906
It's a name!

21
00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:05.330
This is A. A is for apple. A is for ant. This is B. B is for ball. B is for bear.

22
00:02:09.315 --> 00:02:16.393
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:02:16.443 --> 00:02:18.116
Bye-bye, friends!

